js-yaml
-------
MIT licensed; full text at lib/vendor/js-yaml/LICENSE, version in
lib/vendor/js-yaml/VERSION. Vendored as a single ES module so the tool runs
with no npm install, inside a RealTimeX skill bundle or a bare checkout.
Nothing from it is embedded in a rendered sheet, index, or request.
